    "body": "The Makefile declares `update-ref-tags` as phony, but the actual target added is `update-ref`. This mismatch can lead to confusing behavior (e.g., `make update-ref-tags` does nothing, and `update-ref` may be treated as a file target). Rename consistently: either change `.PHONY` to include `update-ref` (and remove `update-ref-tags`), or define an `update-ref-tags:` alias that depends on/runs `update-ref`.",
