    "body": "The `sed -i` flag is not portable across BSD/macOS vs GNU sed. If contributors run this outside the container on macOS, this command will fail. Consider switching this to a portable approach (e.g., using a small script in `scripts/` or a sed invocation compatible with both platforms) so `make update-ref` is cross-platform.\n```suggestion\n\tfor f in ref/*.json; do sed -e '$$a\\' \"$$f\" > \"$$f\".tmp && mv \"$$f\".tmp \"$$f\"; done\n```",
